WEBVTT

A1-1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.400 line:58%,center size:92%
Guide: Select Security in Settings.

B1-1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.676 line:58%,center size:92%
User: Can I discard the old codes

B1-2
00:00:06.676 --> 00:00:07.000 line:58%,center size:92%
now?

A2-1
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.633 line:58%,center size:92%
Guide: Yes. Discard them before

A2-2
00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:11.600 line:58%,center size:92%
saving the new recovery codes.

SFX-1
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.345 line:58%,center size:92%
[Two warning sounds indicating a

SFX-2
00:00:14.345 --> 00:00:15.820 line:58%,center size:92%
failed security check]

A3-1
00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:18.061 line:58%,center size:92%
Guide: Complete the security check

A3-2
00:00:18.061 --> 00:00:19.460 line:58%,center size:92%
again, then confirm issuance.

A4-1
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.295 line:58%,center size:92%
Guide: Save the new codes in a safe

A4-2
00:00:22.295 --> 00:00:24.402 line:58%,center size:92%
place. Once new codes are issued,

A4-3
00:00:24.402 --> 00:00:26.700 line:58%,center size:92%
the old codes can no longer be used.

A5-1
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.191 line:58%,center size:92%
Guide: Check the issuance complete

A5-2
00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:29.580 line:58%,center size:92%
screen.
